'''Zero Luza''' (超生命体ゼロルーザ, ''Chō Seimeitai Zero Rūza'', '''Super-Lifeform Zero Luza''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]/[[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] variant of [[Great Ape Luza]] introduced in [[Revival of Origin]], the final stage of [[Uncanny Legends]]. Zero Luza is one of the two enemy versions of [[Ancient Egg: N000 (Special Cat)|Ape Lord Luza]], whose Normal Form drops from Revival of Origin at a guaranteed chance. It was added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]].

