==Enemy==
Zero Luza is the greatest threat faced in Uncanny Legends. It has a whopping 4 million health with only three knockbacks, 80,000 damage per hit, and strengthens by 100% at 33% health. Combined with its long overall reach, nothing could truly escape its grasp. It is also immune to freeze and [[Wave Attack|waves]], making it all the more difficult to ward off with the constant pressure of any support.

==Strategy==
Zero Luza is able to easily gain ground with the peons but has a somewhat slow attack rate, and its attacks can even be baited, so make sure the peons don't get to you for a clear shot at it. A high-level [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cat]] is the ideal meatshield, surviving even a strengthened hit from Zero Luza (in 3-crown [[Revival of Origin]], a high-level [[Ototo Corps|Curseblast Foundation]] will be needed for it to survive). [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Awakened Doron]], despite not being able to freeze Zero Luza, is nonetheless able to knock it back and help regain ground while doing some chip damage, further supplemented by his ablity to also knockback the Relic support. [[Sniper the Recruit (Super Rare Cat)|Sniper the Deadeye]] can fill a similar role to Awakened Doron, but with much less damage, being capable of not only knocking Luza back, but also outranging its Omni Strikes and slowing for 2 seconds, but beware of [[Bore Jr.]] firing off mini-waves. Otherwise, you can use the [[Ototo Corps|Breakerblast Cannon]] to push Luza back in sticky situations.

